  rel:{"radial-nerve":"its parent nerve",brachioradialis:"the muscle hiding it","median-nerve":"the palm-side nerve","ulnar-nerve":"the little-finger-side nerve"},
  simple:"The superficial radial nerve feels the thumb side of the hand's back — nothing more.",
