  rel:{heart:"its lower chambers",atria:"the priming chambers above",aorta:"the left ventricle ejects into it","pulmonary-trunk":"the right's outlet","heart-valves":"the one-way doors of each"},
  simple:"The ventricles are the heart's two pumps — right sends blood to the lungs, left to the whole body.",
